      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "下列方程的图象是什么图形？",
        "а) $x^2+y^2=0$；　　б) $2x+y=y+2x$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "复习题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "436",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "下列数对的集合各给出了一种关系：",
        "а) $\\{(x,y)\\mid x\\in N,y\\in N,y=7-x\\}$；",
        "б) $\\{(x,y)\\mid x\\in N,y\\in N,xy=6\\}$。",
        "写出已知关系的所有元素对，并作出图象。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "24．二元线性方程"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$5x+2y=10$，$0x+3y=7.5$，$2x+0y=12$，这些方程都可",
        "以写成 $ax+by=c$ 的形式。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$ax+by=c$ 形式的方程（其中 $a$、$b$、$c$ 是数，$x$ 和 $y$ 是变",
        "量），叫做二元线性方程（或二元一次方程）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们来说明，当线性方程的系数 $a$ 和 $b$ 至少有一个不等",
        "于 0 时，它的图象是什么。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "设已知方程是",
        "$5x+2y=10$。",
        "用变量 $x$ 表示 $y$，得",
        "$y=-2.5x+5$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "式 $y=kx+l$（其中 $k$ 和 $l$ 是数）表示的是线性函数。因",
        "此，方程 $y=-2.5x+5$，即方程 $5x+2y=10$，表示的是线性函",
        "数，它的图象是一条直线（图 97）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在所讨论的方程 $ax+by=c$ 中，设系数 $b\\ne0$。当 $b\\ne0$",
        "时，由方程 $ax+by=c$ 得"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
